OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785246499
OL,3,CPolice issue plea after crash kills
OL,4,Cdriver and leaves two injured
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter a driver died in a crash in
OL,8,FBirmingham, which left two other men
OL,9,Fhospitalised.
OL,11,FThe driver, a 33-year-old man, was
OL,12,Fkilled in the collision on Tyburn Road
OL,13,Fat around 2.15am on 27 July.
OL,15,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said
OL,16,Fthe Ford Focus had exited the road
OL,17,Fbefore hitting a tree and rolling onto
OL,18,Fits roof.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
