FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785246499
OL,3,CPolice issue plea after crash kills
OL,4,Cdriver and leaves two injured
OL,6,FParamedics tried to save the driver
OL,7,Fbut he was pronounced dead at the
OL,8,Fscene.
OL,10,FTwo passengers in the car remain in
OL,11,Fhospital with serious injuries.
OL,13,FWest Midlands Police has launched an
OL,14,Finvestigation, and they are asking
OL,15,Fwitnesses of the crash to contact the
OL,16,Fforce.
OL,18,FA force spokesperson said: "We're
OL,19,Fappealing for information after a man
OL,20,Fdied following a collision in
OL,21,FBirmingham.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785246499
OL,3,CPolice issue plea after crash kills
OL,4,Cdriver and leaves two injured
OL,6,F"We were called to Tyburn Road, near
OL,7,Fto the junction of Walker Drive, at
OL,8,Faround 2.15am following reports of a
OL,9,Fserious collision.
OL,11,F"A 33-year-old man, the driver of a
OL,12,Fgrey Ford Focus was found seriously
OL,13,Finjured. Sadly, he died at the scene.
OL,15,F"Two passengers were taken to hospital
OL,16,Fwith serious injuries, where they
OL,17,Fremain.
OL,19,F"Enquiries are underway to establish
OL,20,Fthe exact circumstances of the
OL,21,Fcollision.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785246499
OL,3,CPolice issue plea after crash kills
OL,4,Cdriver and leaves two injured
OL,6,F"The road currently remains closed but
OL,7,Fis expected to reopen later this
OL,8,Fmorning."
OL,10,FA West Midlands Ambulance Service
OL,11,Fspokesperson added: "On arrival, crews
OL,12,Ffound one car had come off the road,
OL,13,Fhit a tree and rolled onto its roof.
OL,15,F"The driver, a man, was in a critical
OL,16,Fcondition.
OL,18,F"After being removed from the car with
OL,19,Fthe assistance of fire colleagues,
OL,20,Fmedics immediately began administering
OL,21,Fadvanced life support.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785246499
OL,3,CPolice issue plea after crash kills
OL,4,Cdriver and leaves two injured
OL,6,F"Sadly, despite everyone's best
OL,7,Fefforts, he could not be saved and was
OL,8,Fconfirmed dead at the scene.
OL,10,F"A second man was treated by ambulance
OL,11,Fstaff for serious injuries whilst a
OL,12,Fthird patient, also a man, was treated
OL,13,Ffor potentially serious injuries.
OL,15,F"Both were conveyed under emergency
OL,16,Fconditions to Queen Elizabeth Hospital
OL,17,Ffor further treatment."
OL,26,@wD@AOU
